"""kei_import: the engine of the Magic Import Tool (Ferramenta de Importação
Mágica) of Koha Easy Installer. One entry point takes any file, folder
or archive, recognises what it holds and prepares it for Koha's own import
tools; the panel asks the questions and commits."""
